node_modules/
*.log

# Deployment-local: the session secret, the internal-API token and the
# database URL all end up here, and none of them belong in the tree.
.env

# Built front end.
/public/

# The picture and the typeface the site reads from web/public/.
#
# Ignored because this checkout does not know where they came from, not because
# the site keeps assets out on principle — it does not. An asset whose origin is
# known belongs in the repository like any other source, which is why the
# heroes directory below is an exception rather than a hole in a rule.
#
# A clone without these two renders on the plain dark ground with a serif
# fallback: a duller site, not a broken one.
#
# The contents rather than the directory: git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so `/web/public/` followed by an exception silently ignores the
# exception too. Checked, not assumed.
#
# See README, "The picture and the face".
/web/public/*
!/web/public/heroes/

# Editor and agent scratch: local paths, not the application.
.claude/
